<title>TURKEY: Turkey's Tupras cancels 50,000 T fuel-oil tender.</title>
<headline>Turkey's Tupras cancels 50,000 T fuel-oil tender.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's state oil refinery, Tupras, has cancelled a tender under which it would import 50,000 tonnes of 3.5-percent fuel-oil to be delivered between June 10-12, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>It did not say why the tender, put out on May 30, was cancelled.</p>
<p>-- Ankara newsroom, 90-312-4462940</p>
</text>
